OL,3,GNEWSABlood delivery driver who ran over
OL,4,Acyclist jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA van driver who was delivering blood
OL,7,Fto a hospital has been jailed for
OL,8,Fdeliberately running over a cyclist who
OL,9,Fhad spat towards him.
OL,11,FMark Okotie, 44, knocked the man off
OL,12,Fhis bike in New Cross Road, Lewisham,
OL,13,Fduring the evening rush hour on 20
OL,14,FMarch 2024, leaving him with several
OL,15,Ffractures.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
