OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABlood delivery driver who ran over
OL,4,Acyclist jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FWoolwich Crown Court heard Okotie had
OL,7,Fmoved his van into the left lane
OL,8,F"seemingly without looking" and came
OL,9,Fclose to the cyclist. At the next set
OL,10,Fof traffic lights, the man spat towards
OL,11,Fthe van and it went through the open
OL,12,Fdriver's window.
OL,14,FOkotie, from Southwark, was jailed for
OL,15,Fthree years and six months, having been
OL,16,Ffound guilty of causing grievous bodily
OL,17,Fharm with intent after a trial earlier
OL,18,Fthis month.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
